The name is a tribute

"Sodium" (钠) is named after Minecraft's Sodium rendering mod by CaffeineMC
(JellySquid), <https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium>, as a nod to what a
rendering engine for one's own client can do. This project is not affiliated
with CaffeineMC, carries none of that mod's code, and is not endorsed by it.
